urity</a> (DAST/STAR), OWASP ZAP (DAST), Burp Suite (DAST), Semgrep (SAST),=
 Contrast (IAST).</p><p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Bright resourc=
es for deeper dives:</strong></p><ul class=3D"wp-block-list"><li><a href=3D=
"https://brightsec.com/blog/web-application-security/?utm_source=3Dchatgpt.=
